# Internal .gitignore for .maestro-space/
# The PARENT .gitignore at the repo root used to exclude the entire .maestro-space/
# directory. After the restructure documented in PR "docs(maestro-space): restructure
# to tracked .maestro-space/ framework (full reconciliation)", .maestro-space/ is
# TRACKED at the repo root (the parent .gitignore only excludes maestro-secrets/).
#
# This file exists as a defensive marker so that:
#   1. Anyone inspecting the structure can see what is and is not tracked
#   2. Per-fork clones that may not have the updated parent .gitignore still keep
#      workflow secrets out
#   3. Future tools that respect per-directory .gitignore behave correctly
#
# Rules:
#   - maestro-secrets/ holds API keys, tokens, and runtime credentials. NEVER tracked.
#   - Everything else in .maestro-space/ is framework documentation, templates, plans,
#     per-task session artifacts, and the agent registry — all TRACKED, all reviewable
#     in pull requests, all subject to the same review pipeline as code.

# Workflow secrets — never tracked
maestro-secrets/*
!/maestro-secrets/.gitkeep
